# Prizes

-**First Prize**: $7,000, ION GNSS+ 2024 free registration for the presenting author, up to 4-nights hotel accommodations at the conference hotel for presenting author, and $1700 incentive for the presenting author to attend the ION GNSS+ 2024
-**Second Prize**: $5,000, ION GNSS+ 2024 free registration for the presenting author, up to 4-nights hotel accommodations at the conference hotel for presenting author, and $1700 incentive for the presenting author to attend ION GNSS+ 2024
-**Third Prize**: $3,000, ION GNSS+ 2024 free registration for the presenting author, up to 4-nights hotel accommodations at the conference hotel for presenting author, and $1700 incentive for the presenting author to attend ION GNSS+ 2024

Note that, there is no requirement for winners to license their solutions. However, to be eligible for prizes, competitors must provide a technical paper, register and present their paper at the ION GNSS+ 2024 conference.

**All papers must be submitted by the ION GNSS+2024 submission deadline (Jun 30, 2024).**

The cash component of the prize money will be paid within six weeks of the competition end date. The conference attendance incentive will be paid out after the conclusion of the ION GNSS+ 2024 conference.
