7212,how-much-would-you-pay-for-a-fake-cat,"# Overview

Welcome to Global Hack Week August: Machine Learning!

This time we're attempting to predict the asking price for a cryptokitty based on its image!

Register for our live streams here:
- [Part 1](https://events.mlh.io/events/10105-ghw-web3-week-maching-learning-and-nfts-track-part-1)
- [Part 2](https://events.mlh.io/events/10121-ghw-web3-week-maching-learning-and-nfts-track-part-2)
