100 to 200, value=40
Otherwise, value=0

FECAL
0 to 5, value=100
5 to 50, value=80
50 to 500, value=60
500 to 10000, value=40
Otherwise, value=0

Suitability% = 28.1%(DO)+ 16.5% (PH)+ 28.1%(CONDUCTIVITY)+ 23.4%(BOD)+ 2.8%(NITRATE)+0.9%(FECAL)
