# What is Cozie?

Cozie is a smartwatch application for human comfort data collection. It prompts users to respond to quick right-here-right-now surveys on smartwatches. Each survey response is tagged with the location of the participant. Cozie is also able to collect additional information, such as heart rate, noise, blood oxygen saturation, step count, etc. Below are screenshots of Cozie on the Apple Watch and the companion app on the iPhone.
