Some of the images will be at different angles, zooms, and lighting. The images are generated to represent a diverse group of people.

![Angles](https://data.heatonresearch.com/images/wustl/kaggle/2023-fall/row-2.jpg)

These images are 512x512 and were generated with Stable Diffusion, they are not real people.

----------------------
# Evaluation

You will be evaluated with logloss.


