7405,predict-the-financial-statements-of-a-crypto-miner,"# Overview

##Welcome to the Synnax Financial Statements Prediction Kaggle competition!

This competition aims to assess the power of AI and Machine Learning models in predicting the financial results of a crypto mining company.

##Objective

The objective is to develop predictive models that can forecast the Financial Statements of a crypto mining company using the provided datasets, and potentially enhance them with external data.

##Early Contributor Program

Synnax is a blockchain project that will be issuing a utility token in the future. If you would like us to be able to identify and reward you in the time to come as an early stage contributor to Synnax, please indicate your Ethereum wallet address in the description field of your submission. All participants who submit an address will be rewarded during the inaugural airdrop of the project¡¯s token, with higher prizes for the top leaderboard positions; so better results in this and subsequent competitions will count in your favor! You may generate a new address for privacy, but make sure to use the same address throughout Synnax events.

----------------------
# Description

##Dataset

The Train and Test files contain financial statements data from a recent year, however the exact time period will remain undisclosed.

##IMPORTANT:

- The first line of the dataset ¡°quarter_day_label¡± indicates to which quarter and day within the quarter the dollar value provided belongs to.

- All the data in the dataset are daily values denominated in United States Dollar

- The lines of the dataset from ¡°tax_effect_of_unusual_items¡± to ¡°total_revenue¡± include items that all together represent the Income Statement of the company

- The lines of the dataset from ¡°invested_capital¡± to ¡°other_intangible_assets¡± include items that all together represent the Balance Sheet of the company

- Participants are encouraged to use public external data (e.g., BTC price, ETH price, Interest Rates) to augment their datasets and improve predictions.

##Submissions

- Income Statement (I/S) Solution: Predict the sum of all daily data points for the 5th Quarter (lines 2 to 23 of the dataset)

- Balance Sheet (B/S) Solution: Predict the last of all daily data points for the 5th Quarter (lines 24 to 43 of the dataset)

##Evaluation
Submissions will be evaluated based on accuracy and precision in predicting financial statement values according to the Absolute Error methodology.","# Dataset Description

The Dataset provides includes the first 4 quarters of daily Financial Statements of a Crypto Miner. The Income Statement (""I/S"") includes daily items related to the day to day business activity of the company while the Balance Sheet (""B/S"") provides details of all assets and liabilities that the company operates with in the course of its business. The columns include 2 labels, the first one identifies the data as Quarter - Day of the quarter while the second label underneath identifies the daily data in progressive number only. The 2 labels are meant to facilitate the work of creating a machine learning model that takes into account the daily dynamics and the quarterly dynamics within a company Financial Statements.

## Files

*   **train.csv** - the training set
*   **test.csv** - the test set
*   **sample_submission.csv** - a sample submission file in the correct format",False,True
