7487,ee370000-introduction-to-machine-learning-labbonus,"# Overview

This is a multiclass image classification.
Different from Lab demo, you can try any advanced method you know to improve performance.
----------------------
# Description

Dataset
we selected 109 species of birds from the BIRDS 525 SPECIES dataset as this dataset.
20047 training images, 2172 test images(about 20 images per species). This is a very high quality dataset where there is only one bird in each image and we have add some distortion. All images are 224 X 224 X 3 color images in jpg format. Data set includes a train set, test set. Training set contains 109 sub directories, one for each bird species.
----------------------
# Evaluation

Submissions are evaluated on [recall] between the predicted probability and the observed target.

## Submission File
For each ID in the test set, you must predict a probability for the target variable. The file should contain a header and have the following format:

    ID,label
    2,0
    5,0
    6,0
    etc.","# Dataset Description

Files
the dataset is on the google drive.
https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1BphNmQHn49alv462hrEyV0_FnjQKSTIc?usp=drive_link
train - the training set
test - the test set
submission_sample.csv - a sample submission file in the correct format",False,True
