[English]
The data is split into three folders:
Train: This folder is for teaching the model, using pictures (JPG) and their details (XML).
Valid: It's for adjusting hyperparameter, with pictures (JPG) and their details (XML).
Test: This one is for trying out the model, with pictures (JPG).
Folder images can be of different sizes (1024x768, 1280x720)
The details about where objects are in pictures are in XML files, in Pascal-Voc format.

For the submission file (CSV), each row is for a picture (Id). It should look like this:

submission.csv
| Id  | img | box |
| --- | --- |
