| 1 | 0 | list([xmin_2, ymin_2, xmax_2, ymax_2, score_2, 1-score_2])
| ... | ... | ... |
| k | 824 | list([xmin_k, ymin_k, xmax_k, ymax_k, score_k, 1-score_k])

Each ""box_i"" has information about where an object is in the picture and how confident the model is that it is object.",False,True
