- The evaluation metric is ROC-AUC, and it can be easily calculated using scikit-learn.
- Please note that the predicted values in the submission file are not 1 or 0, but ""probability values"".
- If you have any other questions etc, please feel free to ask in the Discussion.

```python
from sklearn.metrics import roc_auc_score

correct_value = [0, 1, 1, 1, 1, ........... ]
predict_value = [0.59, 0.81, 0.93, 0.94, 0.94, .......... ]

ROC_AUC = roc_auc_score(correct_value, predict_value)
```

