* **March 21, 2024  4PM UTC** - Final Submission Deadline. Note that Kaggle will release updated data at least once in advance of the deadline in order to include as much of the current season's data as possible.

* **March 21 - April 8** - Watch your tournament results play out! Kaggle will refresh the leaderboard throughout the tournaments.

