## 1.B. Defense Task: Bot Detection using Multimodal Data
### Objective
In this second task, the competitors should use all of the recorded events in the attribution mechanisms. The following describes the inputs, outputs, and deliverables for this subtask.

#### Input
- `name` chosen randomly and uniformly from `[¡®hlisa_traces¡¯, ¡®gremlins¡¯, ¡®za_proxy¡¯, ¡®survey_desktop¡¯, ¡®random_mouse_with_sleep_bot¡¯]`
