- The dataframe values starting from the randomly chosen index `df_dict_init[name][idx:]`

#### Output
- An estimate `estimated_name` of the type of the user from `[¡®hlisa_traces¡¯, ¡®gremlins¡¯, ¡®za_proxy¡¯, ¡®survey_desktop¡¯, ¡®random_mouse_with_sleep_bot¡¯]`
- Number of events read before outputting the name estimate (the lower the better).

#### Deliverables
The following plots are required (plots provided with examples for further illustration)

1.  Multi-Modal Classification Accuracy (Accuracy of correct class attribution among all classes)
