<ul>
<li><strong>train.csv</strong> - the training set</li>
<li><strong>test.csv</strong> - the test set</li>
<li><strong>sample_submission.csv</strong> - a sample submission file in the correct format</li>
<li><strong>store_location.csv</strong> - attributes of stores (data is obfuscated) </li>
</ul>
<h2>Data fields</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>product_rk</strong> - id of a product, there is only 6 different products in data set</li>
<li><strong>store_location_rk</strong> - id of a store</li>
<li><strong>period_start_dt</strong> - date (a Monday date of a week)</li>
<li><strong>demand</strong> - target variable (double), is missing for the forecasting period (i.e. since 02Dec2019 to 30Dec2019)</li>

