*   `ESSENTIAL_COMPLEXITY` - numeric
*   `LOC_EXECUTABLE` - numeric
*   `HALSTEAD_CONTENT` - numeric
*   `HALSTEAD_DIFFICULTY` - numeric
*   `HALSTEAD_EFFORT` - numeric
*   `HALSTEAD_ERROR_EST` - numeric
*   `HALSTEAD_LENGTH` - numeric
*   `HALSTEAD_LEVEL` - numeric
*   `HALSTEAD_PROG_TIME` - numeric
*   `HALSTEAD_VOLUME` - numeric
*   `NUM_OPERANDS` - numeric
*   `NUM_OPERATORS` - numeric
*   `NUM_UNIQUE_OPERANDS` - numeric
*   `NUM_UNIQUE_OPERATORS` - numeric
*   `LOC_TOTAL` - numeric
*   `Defective` - the response variable {Y,N}",False,True
