```","# Dataset Description

The dataset consists of 6 ROS2 bag files. The development bags contain the three image topics as well as a wide range of mavros topics. See [this documentation] (http://wiki.ros.org/mavros#mavros.2FPlugins.local_position) for more details about the different messages contained in the ROS2 bag. The mavros data can help you to develop and validate your algorithm. 

Additionally we provide ground truth CSV files in the [TUM RGB-D file format](https://cvg.cit.tum.de/data/datasets/rgbd-dataset/file_formats). We interpolated the poses of the `/mavros/local_position/pose` topic to obtain an exact pose per frame of the front-facing camera. The script is available for download as part of the dataset.

The test bags only contain the image topics and no ground truth is provided until the end of this competition.


|  Image Topic Name | Message Type | Description
| --- | --- | --- |
| /cam_0/image_raw/compressed | [CompressedImage](https://docs.ros2.org/latest/api/sensor_msgs/msg/CompressedImage.html) | left-facing camera |
| /cam_1/image_raw/compressed | [CompressedImage](https://docs.ros2.org/latest/api/sensor_msgs/msg/CompressedImage.html) | front-facing camera |
| /cam_2/image_raw/compressed | [CompressedImage](https://docs.ros2.org/latest/api/sensor_msgs/msg/CompressedImage.html) | right-facing camera |

## Camera Setup

The camera setup covers a wide field of view:

- 1 front camera (67¡ã HFOV)
- 2 side cameras (200¡ã HFOV, fish-eye lenses)

The following figure visualizes how the cameras are located to each other.

![Camera Setup](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-user-content/o/inbox%2F14858017%2Ffc92a57d5c65c37093c23c6867067522%2Fcamera_setup.png?generation=1711436815475314&alt=media)

The images of the side-facing cameras are partially blocked by the drone's landing gear as shown in the next image.

![Blocked Camera](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-user-content/o/inbox%2F14858017%2F4327f0b1f4fa3124dac855d5aa1622d2%2FSaale_01.png?generation=1711437441525247&alt=media)

## Files

*   **development_bag_*** - the bag files for development
*   **test_bag_*** - the bag files for testing your algorithm
*   ***_kaggle.txt** - ground truth data for the development bag files",False,True
