7880,fuel-efficiency-forecasting,"# Overview

Fuel efficiency forecasting¡ªTHU¡ªGeoscience High performance computing and big Data course assignment
----------------------
# Description

- Download Auto-mpg data
   Please download the training and test data from the Data section of this competition web page to ensure that the data is the same for everyone.
- Install a jupyter notebook in the conda environment on your computer or server
- Data operation can be designed by yourself, including data cleaning, splitting training set test set, normalization, etc. Data Please use the two files in the Data column on this contest web page, the training set is used to train the model, and the test set is used to make predictions and upload the results.
- Establish a neural network model based on Pytorch on your own computer or server for training, select MSE as Loss function, and predict fuel efficiency (mpg, miles per gallon).
- Upload the test result to kaggle and pay attention to the submission limit. After submitting the result, you can choose whether to add the submitted result to the leaderboard. If it is added to the leaderboard, the ranking will be updated in real time.
- Submit ipynb files to webclass (including code, comments, running results, pictures, etc.)
- 2 weeks to complete
----------------------
# Evaluation

Download the auto-mpg-test.data in the data, use the model to forecast the fuel efficiency, do not change the data order, and export the fuel efficiency to a CSV file. The first column in the CSV file is the serial number ID, which is the order in auto-mpg-test.data, and the second column is the predicted result of your model output, which is the fuel efficiency.

Example:
ID   RESULT
1     30.5
2     46
3     40
...","# Dataset Description

Please download the following data files, including the training set (auto-mpg-train.data) and the test set (auto-mpg-test.data), use the training set to train the model, the test set is used to make fuel efficiency predictions, and upload the test results.",False,True
