- [Triple Negative Breast Cancer Datathon ¨C A Tutorial](https://www.widsworldwide.org/get-inspired/blog/triple-negative-breast-cancer-datathon-a-tutorial/) by Sharada Kalanidhi, WiDS Datathon Technical Director
- [Predicting Time to Diagnosis for the WiDS Datathon #2](https://blogs.mathworks.com/student-lounge/2024/04/09/predicting-time-to-diagnosis-for-the-wids-datathon-2/) with corresponding [video tutorial](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7LZD6LeCkhY) by Grace Woolson, Mathworks
- [Data Science Modules](https://github.com/ds-modules) by UC Berkeley Professor
- Attend a [WiDS Datathon Workshop](https://www.widsworldwide.org/events/?_sfm_event_type=Datathon%20Workshop) led by global WiDS ambassadors

