# to save predictions
pd.to_csv('prediction_task2.csv', index=False)
```

## Baselines [[Github](https://github.com/pan-webis-de/pan-code/tree/master/semeval23/baselines)]

For the first project milestone, you need to run the naive baselines for task 1 and task 2 in [this Github repo](https://github.com/pan-webis-de/pan-code/tree/master/semeval23/baselines).

## Evaluation
We will use the Meteor score to evaluate the classifier's performance for task 2.

## Acknowledgements
We thank the [original competition](https://pan.webis.de/semeval23/pan23-web/clickbait-challenge.html#) hosts for providing the datasets.
----------------------
# Evaluation

The evaluation metric for this competition is <a href=""https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/METEOR"">Meteor</a>. METEOR (Metric for Evaluation of Translation with Explicit ORdering) is a metric for the evaluation of machine translation output. The metric is based on the harmonic mean of unigram precision and recall, with recall weighted higher than precision","# Dataset Description

