# Description

**Data Visualization Media Art**

 - For analysis and Data Visualization Media Art, usage of external data(copyright-proven) as well as given transportation data from smartway.seoul.go.kr is permitted on the competition with the condition of sharing with all.

![](https://www.ucomp.co.kr/upload_data/story/20230905101559_24.jpg)
Example of ""Data Visualization Media Art"", Available at [https://youtu.be/9TVjJETg3uw?si=mujxSiSMAXDvj_ln](https://youtu.be/9TVjJETg3uw?si=mujxSiSMAXDvj_ln)

This video visualizes data concerning light from the perspectives of 'safety' and 'happiness.' It focuses on four districts in Seoul¡ªGwanak-gu, Seocho-gu, Gangnam-gu, and Seongdong-gu. The visualization incorporates data on starlight, streetlights, and fine dust. Initially, the data on streetlights, which ensure ground safety, and starlight, which serves as an indicator from the sky, are visualized in a virtual space. Additionally, annual fine dust measurements for each district are applied to the flow of air.

In the video, the symbolic flowers of each district¡ªazaleas (Gwanak-gu), roses (Seocho-gu), magnolias (Gangnam-gu), and forsythias (Seongdong-gu)¡ªmetaphorically represent the beauty of each area. The density of streetlights and the annual data on stars decorating the night sky provide intuitive and accurate information based on each district's identity.


