**Data Analysis Algorithm**
File descriptions

Provided files are representing eight expressway traffic of Seoul city, Korea, in YR2021~2023
Expressways including: 
1. Naebu Ringway
2. Gangbyeonbuk-ro
3. Bukbu Arterial Road	
4. Olympic-daero	
5. Dongbu Arterial Road	
6. Bundangsuseo-ro	
7. Gyeongbu Expressway	
8. Gangnam Beltway

**Guideline: **
Comparison by annual date - Compare the same day of the week in the same week number, in two years that are not the same day (ex: Comparison between Monday of the Week ""A"" and Tuesday of the Week ""B"", Week 1 and Week 52 of all years are excluded from comparison)
<!-- ?? ??? ?? - ???? ?? 2??? ?? ?? ?? ??? ?? (ex: 1?? ???~52?? ??? ??, ?? ??? 1??? 52??? ?? ???? ??), ?? ??? ????? ?? ???? ??  
??1: 8? ??? ????? ???? ????? ??? ?? ?? ?? ???? ??? F, ??? T
??2: 8? ??? ???? ???? ???? ??? ?? ?? ?? ???? ??? F, ??? T -->
- Determination 1: Based on the average speed of 8 roads, F if the average speed(km/h) is slower than the same day of week of the previous year, T if it is faster
- Determination 2: Based on the traffic volume of 8 roads, F if the traffic volume(vehicles/day) is more than that of the same day of week of previous year on the same day of the week, T if it is less.

In addition to correctly predicting True as True, it is also correct when predicting False as False. As an example, compared to last year's situation, 
1) the average speed is fast, 
2) the traffic volume is low, it is low. 
In this way, [the accuracy score](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.metrics.accuracy_score.html) is used as an indicator to consider cases where intuitive discrimination is required. The expressed formula is as follows: 

![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-user-content/o/inbox%2F5582579%2F7fc7a60a06dc9fc5893feddf42bd621f%2FAccuracy.png?generation=1720157259049802&alt=media)



