?	
 

est cr¨¦¨¦ par ceci :

$$ \epsilon = \sqrt{x\_n^2+1} $$

Utilisez ces conventions pour formater vos pages et am¨¦liorer la clart¨¦ de votre description. Bonne chance dans votre comp¨¦tition et amusez-vous bien !
----------------------
# Evaluation

Submissions will be evaluated based on the accuracy of the predicted click-through rate (CTR) labels for article titles. Here¡¯s how submissions will be scored and how participants should format their submission files.

Submissions are evaluated based on the accuracy between the predicted labels and the observed labels.

Submission File
For each ID in the test set, you must predict a label for the ctr_label variable. The file should contain a header and be in the following format:

csv
