# **Hello Everyone Welcome to the kaggle Clash Minsky'24: Sales price prediction**

In this competition, participants are challenged to predict household prices based on various property features. The dataset includes essential information such as building classification, zoning classifications, lot size, street access types, and property shape. Competitors will develop regression models to estimate sale prices, with evaluations based on Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE). This competition aims to enhance data analysis and machine learning skills among college students.
