----------------------
# Objectives

- Develop a multi-class classification model to predict patient outcomes.
- Explore various modeling techniques, including but not limited to decision trees, ensemble methods, and neural networks.
- Optimize models for accuracy, precision, and recall to achieve the best possible predictions.
----------------------
# Evaluation

Submissions will be evaluated based on a specified metric (e.g., accuracy, F1 score) on a hidden test set. Detailed evaluation criteria will be provided, ensuring transparency and fairness in the competition.","# Dataset Description

