8388,multi-ffdi-phase2,"# Overview

The page is solely for submitting test results in Phase 2 of Deepfake Image Detection in the Inclusion?The Global Multimedia Deepfake Detection Challenge. It can be used only by registered teams in Phase 1. 

For full information about this competition, please refer to https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/multi-ffdi/overview.
----------------------
# Evaluation

The evaluation metric is the same as that used in Track 1. Please refer to www.kaggle.com/competitions/multi-ffdi/overview/evaluation for more details.
----------------------
# Important Dates

- Jun 30: Begin of challenge
- Jul 31: Deadline for registration & team verification
- Aug 15: Test set available for downloading
- Aug 22: Deadline for test results submission
- Aug 26: Deadline for code & technical report submission and begin of code review and hidden set scoring
- Early Sep: Final results available
----------------------
# Prizes & Awards

Please refer to www.kaggle.com/competitions/multi-ffdi/overview/prizes-awards for more details.
----------------------
# Contact us

Please refer to www.kaggle.com/competitions/multi-ffdi/overview/contact-us for more details.","# Dataset Description

The public test set is released in our main page [here](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/multi-ffdi/data). Participants need to submit the prediction score file prediction_test.csv of the test set in the system.",False,True
