 Accuracy is calculated as the sum of correct predictions divided by the total number of predictions, respectively.

 ACC = (TP + TN)/(FP + FN + TP + TN)

## Submission File
For each Image_id in the test set, you must predict the class of the image. The file should contain a header and have the following format:
```
