* https://isslab.csie.ncu.edu.tw/download/publications/5.The%20effect%20of%20feature%20selection%20on%20financial%20distress%20prediction.pdf

It is important remark the analytics flow.

----------------------
# Description

# main goal

The main goal is predict correctly the variable *event*, the features as ""Activos corrientes totales"" correspond to the feature one year before of the event for the bankrupt company and by no-bankrupt is the mean of the period of activity.

----------------------
# Evaluation

The metric to evaluate the model is AUC!.

## Submission File
For each index in the test set, you must predict a probability for the TARGET (event) variable. The file should contain a header and have the following format:

index,prediction
    2,0
    5,0
    6,0
    etc.","# Dataset Description

