8477,geek-haven-ml-contest,"# Overview

**IIIT-Allahabad**'s prestigious technical society, **Geek Haven**, is back with an exciting Machine Learning competition. Apply your ML algorithms to win this contest and earn a chance to secure a position within the esteemed Geek Haven community.

----------------------
# Description

- **Clean Code**: Clean EDA and Preprocessed IPYNB File has seperate grace marks.
- **Max 25 submissions per day**: You can submit your predictions up to 25 times daily.
- **Single player**: This is an individual contest; team submissions are not allowed.
- **No cheating**: Ensure all submissions are your own work. Plagiarism will lead to disqualification.
- **Best of luck**: Give your best effort and aim for the top!
- **Support**: For any doubts or questions, feel free to reach out to [iec2022077@iiita.ac.in](mailto:iec2022077@iiita.ac.in) or [iit2022119@iiita.ac.in](mailto:iit2022119@iiita.ac.in).

----------------------
# Evaluation

