*  `0,1,...` - flattened array from fire location predictions
![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-user-content/o/inbox%2F7329892%2Fd463685965e51e7bb515b704c62f2b7f%2Fflameai-fig-2.png?generation=1726962366515635&alt=media)",False,True
