[https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1OUoq5vdGl_uAhf4E42Gx4Blcvg7L0Q-M?usp=sharing](url)
With this dataset, you can explore the challenging task of training your model to predict the parent-child relationship for each of the detected entities.. The provided files are meant to assist you in building a robust and accurate model for this competition. We hope this dataset will inspire creative solutions and foster progress in this data, Happy modelling!",False,True
