8717,prediccion-sobre-el-valor-del-nasdaq,"# Overview

This project seeks to process price data to analyze trends and classify them, and thus prepare a model so that it can predict specific patterns of price rise and fall.
The file contains per line the temporal information of the Nasdaq candles along with a set of indicators associated with the candle. The target column is Accion, this column can take values ??from 0 to 3, the value 1 means that a purchase operation would have been satisfactory. The value 2 symbolizes that a vein operation would have been satisfactory. Values ??0 and 3 symbolize that it is better not to operate. 

Therefore, the values ??that [1,1] and [2,2] have in the confusion matrix are important, while the values ??[1,2], [2,1],[0,1] and [0, 2] would negatively penalize entries since we would go against the market.
