# Evaluation

Submissions are evaluated on **accuracy**, which measures the percentage of correctly classified instances out of the total instances in the dataset. Accuracy reflects the model's ability to make correct predictions overall, with higher accuracy indicating better alignment between predicted and observed values.","# Dataset Description

