Hello! ??

Welcome to the 2024 KHUGGLE Competition!

Here is some information about the competition:

¡ù Competition Objectives
1. Design an INR (Implicit Neural Representation) structure that can generalize and learn the given dataset effectively.
2. Develop training methods that enable the INR structure to achieve fast and high performance.
3. Achieve high performance within the scope of the provided metrics and competition rules.

=================================================================

¡ù  Competition Schedule
Start: December 6, 2024, 13:00
End: December 17, 2024, 23:59
Review Period: December 18, 2024 - December 20, 2024 (Private score +  Reproduce)
Awards Announcement: Scheduled for December 23 - December 27, 2024

=================================================================
¡ù Competition Rules
1. The INR model is limited to 100 test steps per image (no restrictions on training steps).
2. The INR model must use the same architecture for all images (different models for individual images are not allowed)
3. The solution must be executable on Google Colab (final submission should include a reproducible .ipynb file).
4. Reproducibility: Rankings will be invalidated if the results cannot be reproduced or the performance cannot be replicated after the competition ends.
5. You restricted to submit only 15 per day.

¡ù Contact Information
Mobile : 010-9383-2203
E-mail : jrespect.im@khu.ac.kr
Office : Electronics Building 350

Thank you for your participation, and good luck to all contestants! ??

