8827,best-portfolio,"# Overview

Hi everyone!
I want to set a portfolio including stock, indices, cryptocurrency, gold and silver. dataset of this markets can be downloaded from yahoo finance. but what is the best model and foctors for combination of this portfolio? and how can we calculate the risk of them?
----------------------
# Description

Welcome to the Portfolio Optimization Challenge! In this competition, participants are tasked with optimizing a portfolio that includes five major assets: Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Gold, Silver, and the S&P 500 Index. The objective is to achieve the highest possible return while adhering to a defined risk constraint. To make the problem more dynamic, BTC and ETH come with an added feature¡ªoption contracts for a married put strategy, ensuring that the maximum loss for these cryptocurrencies is capped at 3%. This creates a unique opportunity to explore hedging strategies and integrate risk mitigation directly into the portfolio optimization process.

Participants will need to employ advanced financial modeling techniques, ranging from traditional portfolio theory to cutting-edge machine learning methods. The challenge involves analyzing historical data, understanding asset correlations, and implementing strategies that balance risk and reward effectively. With assets spanning cryptocurrencies, precious metals, and equities, this competition offers a rich and realistic scenario for portfolio management enthusiasts, financial analysts, and data scientists to showcase their expertise and innovation.
----------------------
# Evaluation

Evaluation Criteria
The evaluation of this competition will focus on two key aspects: portfolio performance and risk management effectiveness. Participants' portfolios will be assessed primarily based on their risk-adjusted returns, measured using the Sharpe Ratio. This metric evaluates the excess return per unit of risk, rewarding strategies that maximize returns while keeping volatility low. To ensure comprehensive evaluation, additional performance metrics such as the Sortino Ratio, which considers downside risk, and maximum drawdown, indicating the largest peak-to-trough decline, will also be analyzed.

A critical factor in the evaluation is the incorporation of the married put strategy for BTC and ETH. The proposed portfolios must respect the constraint that losses on these assets cannot exceed 3% under the worst-case scenario. Portfolios that fail to adhere to this risk constraint will be penalized. Additionally, diversification will play a key role in the scoring¡ªportfolios that allocate capital across all assets effectively, rather than concentrating excessively on a single asset, will be favored. Together, these criteria ensure that the winning portfolios strike a balance between profitability, robustness, and real-world feasibility.","# Dataset Description

The datasets provided for this competition encompass 5 years of historical data for the five assets: BTC (Bitcoin), ETH (Ethereum), Gold, Silver, and the S&P 500 Index. Each dataset includes key features such as daily open, high, low, close, adjusted close prices, and trading volume (where applicable). This data offers a comprehensive view of price movements and market behavior over time, enabling participants to analyze trends, correlations, and volatility. With this robust historical data, participants can develop and test their portfolio optimization strategies under diverse market conditions.",False,True
