Apply your new knowledge of Neural Networks with this exercise: create a Neural Network that classifies images of numbers with their corresponding numerical values. We encourage you to experiment and have fun! Use the pinned notebook as a guide and feel free to expand on it! You have until the end of winter break, even though this is a relatively quick competition. ????
