# Evaluation

The evaluation metric for this competition is Categorical Accuracy, which is calculating the ratio of the number of correctly predicted numbers to the number of data points.

## Submission Format


The file should contain a header and have the following format:
```
id, label
BDFSS, 0
BDFST, 5
BDFSU, 7
etc.
```","# Dataset Description

