using the following types of model to predicting next prediction(s) of given time-series:
- statistical model (e.g., ARIMIA) / machine learning model (e.g., XGBoost, CatBoost)
- Deep Learning model (e.g., MLP, CNN, RNN)
- Transformer and its variants (e.g., Vanilla Transformer, Autoformer, Informer...)
- LLM and time-series foundation model


