8850,sales-colombia-regression-ai-page,"# Overview

This competition used the data of DANE
----------------------
# Description

The main goal is predict the variable VENT, see the documentation [Here](https://github.com/it-ces/PUBLIC-AI/blob/main/Kaggle%20compentecia/ddi-documentation-spanish-833.pdf)
----------------------
# Evaluation

Submissions are evaluated uing  **Mean Squared Error**.

# Submission File
For each ID in the test set, you must predict the variable VENTA  The file should contain a header and have the following format:

index,VENTA
     ""0"",5413
     ""12"",5661
     ""3"",4412
    etc.","# Dataset Description

This dataset was extracted FROM DANE have financial information about some bussiness.

## Files

*   **train.csv** - the training set
*   **test.csv** - the test set
*   **sample_submission.csv** - a sample submission file in the correct format
*   **metaData.csv** - supplemental information about the data",False,True
