----------------------
# Evaluation

##Goal

Your task is to predict how many days per week each gym client attends their workouts.

For each client in the test set, you must predict an integer value representing the number of days they train weekly.

---

## Submission File
You should submit a CSV file with exactly 973 entries plus a header row. Your submission will show an error if you include extra columns (beyond id and Workout_Frequency (days/week)) or rows.

The file should have exactly 2 columns:

- id(sorted in any order)
- Workout_Frequency (days/week)(contains your predicted integer values for the number of training days per week)

