----------------------
# Description

You are given a point cloud of certain object class, you have to predict the class.


----------------------
# Evaluation

Balanced Accuracy will be used for evaluation.

### Submission File
For each FNAME in the test set, you must predict the label for the FNAME. The file should contain a header and have the following format:

**FNAME,LABEL**
08_274854.bin,8
05_117171.bin,8
05_153913.bin,8
etc.

