# Team Formation

WiDS aims to provide women with hands-on experiences addressing real-world problems, to inspire women worldwide to hone their data science skills, and to create a supportive environment for women to connect with others in their community who share their interests. Team formation guidelines for the WiDS Datathon are as such:

>*The WiDS Datathon is open to individuals or teams of up to 4; at least half of each team must be individuals who identify as women.*

Once you join a team on Kaggle, you cannot remove yourself from the team. 

