Welcome to the 2024 Kaggle Playground Series! Happy New Year! This is the 1st episode of Season 4. We¡¯re continuing the tradition of providing interesting and approachable datasets for the community to sharpen their machine learning skills ¡ª with a new challenge each month.

Your Goal: In this episode, you¡¯ll build a model to predict whether a customer will churn ¡ª that is, close their account or stay.

But here¡¯s the twist: alongside traditional models like XGBoost, we invite you to try out NdLinear ¡ª a new drop-in replacement for nn.Linear that improves generalization while reducing parameters, FLOPs, and memory. It works across MLPs, Transformers, RNNs, and more.

