# FAQ

## Frequently Asked Questions

Feel free to ask questions in the [Kaggle Discussion Forum](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/detect-ai-vs-human-generated-images/discussion?sort=hotness) throughout the competition. Below are some frequently asked questions and details. 

