This is a fun competition to predict the next position of player in minecraft.
It can be useful, for example, to predict where to shoot using Bow to hit player.
The metric is simple - closer to predict, lower the metric (metric is mean error).
You will get a time series data and player attributes like coordinates to make final predictions.

WE ARE FULL OPEN! No private notebooks! No private code! Publish all the decisions to all, MAXIMUM OPEN SOURCE!

NOTE: the competition is only for FUN and is experimental. Its train (and all collected including private and public test scoring) data may have stupid error or something and was not good viewed or validated.

