-- Sect: Sect of the user.
-- Caste: Caste of the user.
-- State: State of residence of the user.

**Interactions Data (Interactions.csv):**

- Contains information about user interactions.
- Columns:
-- Member_ID: Unique identifier for the initiator of the interaction.
-- Target_ID: Unique identifier for the receiver of the interaction.
-- Note: This dataset contains only positive samples (users who expressed interest in each other).

**Submission Format (recommendations.csv):**

