### Welcome to Data Vision 2025 ¨C A Competition by the Data Science Club @ SR University  

The goal of **Data Vision 2025** is to provide data science enthusiasts with hands-on challenges to enhance their skills in machine learning and data science. This competition is designed for students and practitioners to experiment with real-world data scenarios, refine their analytical abilities, and apply various modeling and feature engineering techniques.  

The competition consists of two exciting parts:  
