- **INDUS** ¨C Proportion of non-retail business acres per town  
- **CHAS** ¨C Charles River dummy variable (1 if the tract bounds the river, 0 otherwise)  
- **NOX** ¨C Nitrogen oxide concentration (pollution level)  
- **RM** ¨C Average number of rooms per dwelling  
- **AGE** ¨C Proportion of owner-occupied units built before 1940  
- **DIS** ¨C Weighted distance to five major employment centers  
- **RAD** ¨C Index of accessibility to radial highways  
- **TAX** ¨C Property tax rate per $10,000  
- **PTRATIO** ¨C Pupil-teacher ratio in town  
- **B** ¨C Proportion of Black residents per town (deprecated in some versions)  
- **LSTAT** ¨C Percentage of lower-status population  

### Target Variable
- **MEDV (Median House Value)**  
  - The median home price (in **$1000s**).  
  - The goal is to **predict this value** based on the 13 input features.
----------------------
# Evaluation

The test will be evaluated using MSE. The lower the better.","# Dataset Description

