 [how to add dataset to your notebook.](https://ibb.co/HdNsLjq)

<h2>File descriptions</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>emnist-byclass-train.npz</strong> - the training images and labels</li>
<li><strong>emnist-byclass-test.npz</strong> - the test images</li>
<li><strong>simple_nn_train.ipynb</strong> - A Jupyter notebook example of training a simple DNN model </li>
</ul>",False,True
