Goal: Get hands-on experience designing and training segmentation and detection networks using PyTorch and Detectron2.

Note that the number of submissions is limited to a few times per day, so try to tune your model before uploading CSV files. Also, you must make at least one submission for your final system. The best performance will be considered.
----------------------
# Evaluation

Submissions are evaluated on IoU between the predicted segmentation and the ground segmentations.","# Dataset Description

The data uploaded here is just the json file. Please go through GitHub README to get the links to train and test images",False,True
