2. Non-commercial Use: AG-VPReID dataset is for non-commercial research and educational purposes only. Any commercial use of the dataset or any part thereof is strictly prohibited.

3. Redistribution: Redistribution of AG-VPReID dataset or any part thereof is strictly prohibited. This dataset is only available for download from the official competition platform.

4. Attribution: Any publication or research work based on AG-VPReID dataset must include proper attribution to the dataset. The recommended citation format is as follows: ""AG-VPReID dataset, Nguyen et al., 2025"".

5. Ethical Usage: The AG-VPReID dataset should be used ethically and responsibly. Users should not use the dataset for any illegal or unethical purposes. Additionally, users should not attempt to re-identify any individuals represented in the dataset in real life. The dataset is anonymized to protect the privacy of individuals, and any attempts to re-identify individuals are strictly prohibited.

6. Reporting: If you find any issues or problems with the AG-VPReID dataset, please report them to the dataset authors or maintainers as soon as possible.

7. No Warranty: The AG-VPReID dataset is provided ""as is"" without any warranty or representation of accuracy, completeness, or reliability.

8. Modifications: Modifications of the AG-VPReID dataset are strictly prohibited without prior permission from the dataset authors or maintainers.

9. Usage Limitation: Users should not attempt to use the AG-VPReID dataset to create a competing dataset or to replicate or improve upon the dataset.

10. Compliance: Users must comply with all applicable laws and regulations related to the use of the AG-VPReID dataset, including but not limited to privacy laws and intellectual property laws.

By downloading and using the AG-VPReID dataset, you agree to these terms and conditions. If you do not agree to these terms and conditions, you should not download or use the dataset.
