Software engineers balance between productivity and distractions every day. From countless meetings to endless coffee refills, predicting whether an engineer will have a productive day is no easy task!

Your mission, should you choose to accept it, is to build a machine learning model that predicts if a software engineer will have a **productive day (1) or not (0)** based on various real-life factors. But beware¡ªthis dataset contains some **hidden anomalies**! Only those with sharp **Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) skills** will uncover them!
