1. **Submit your predictions** and climb the leaderboard!

## ?? Ready to Take on the Challenge?
Start your journey by **downloading the dataset** and **applying your EDA and modeling skills**! May the most productive data scientist win! ??
----------------------
# Evaluation

## ?? Evaluation Metric
Submissions will be evaluated using **Accuracy** and/or **F1 Score**. Your model should not only predict well but also handle anomalies effectively!",,False,True
