# Dataset Description

## ??? Files Provided

```plaintext
/data
    /train
        /images/  # Synthetic images
        /labels/  # YOLO format annotations
    /val
        /images/  # Synthetic validation images
        /labels/  # YOLO format annotations
    /test
        /images/  # Real-world images (ones you'll be judged on) 
```
### Key Files:
- **data.zip**: Contains `/train/images`, `/train/labels` , `/val/images`, `/val/labels` and `/test/images` (real-world data)

---

## ?? Data Format
### 1. **Images**  
- Format: `.jpg`  
- Dimensions: All synthetic images are `1920x1080px`.  

### 2. **Labels (YOLO Format)**  
Each image has a corresponding `.txt` file with annotations:  
class_id x_center y_center width height

- Values are **normalized** (0-1) relative to image dimensions  
- Example (`0001.txt`):  
0 0.45 0.50 0.20 0.15 # One Cheerio box
0 0.70 0.30 0.10 0.12 # Another Cheerio box


### 3. **Class ID**  
- Only **class 0**: Cheerio box (no other classes present)

---

## ??**IMPORTANT!** 
 
The **dataset on our website** offers a **richer set of high-variability synthetic images**, designed to help **improve model generalization** and **improve real-world performance.**  

 **What¡¯s Inside?**
